  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nIf you control \"Supreme King Z-ARC\", you
    take no damage. Once per turn, if you have \"Supreme King Gate Infinity\" in
    your other Pendulum Zone: You can destroy both cards in your Pendulum Zones,
    and if you do, add 1 \"Polymerization\" Spell Card or \"Fusion\" Spell Card from
    your Deck to your hand.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nOnce per turn: You can target
    1 other face-up card you control; destroy both it and this card, and if you do,
    Special Summon 1 Dragon-Type Fusion or Synchro Monster from your Extra Deck,
    but its ATK and DEF become 0, it has its effects negated, also it cannot be used
    as a Material for a Synchro or Xyz Summon. If this card in the Monster Zone is
    destroyed by battle or card effect: You can place this card in your Pendulum
    Zone."
